"**What happened**\n\n(what you saw, and what you expected)\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. \n\n**Setup**\n\nLess Pull 1.4.4 build %@, macOS %ld.%ld.%ld, %lu display(s)\n\n<details><summary>Diagnostics</summary>\n\n```\n%@\n%@\n```\n</details>\n" = "**Что произошло**\n\n(что вы увидели и чего ожидали)\n\n**Шаги**\n\n1. \n\n**Окружение**\n\nLess Pull 1.4.4 сборка %@, macOS %ld.%ld.%ld, экранов: %lu\n\n<details><summary>Диагностика</summary>\n\n```\n%@\n%@\n```\n</details>\n";
